# 🚩 Challenge: [Super SSH]
![super_ssh_description](super_ssh.png)

## 📝 Challenge Description

Using a Secure Shell (SSH) is going to be pretty important. Can you ssh as ctf-player to chatelaine.cylabacademy.net at port 40332 to get the flag?

You'll also need the password fd7746b4. If asked, accept the fingerprint with yes.

If your device doesn't have a shell, you can use: https://webshell.cylabacademy.org

If you're not sure what a shell is, check out our Primer: https://primer.cylabacademy.org/#_the_shell

Instance
Expires in 6:09
Hints
1. https://linux.die.net/man/1/ssh

2. You can try logging in 'as' someone with <user>@chatelaine.cylabacademy.net

3. How could you specify the port?

4. Remember, passwords are hidden when typed into the shell

### Code / Terminal Snippets
1. ssh ctf-player@chatelaine.cylabacademy.net -p 40332
2. Enter password:fd7746b4
